---
// Interactive payment simulator: DemoFrame wrapper around UnbundledPaymentDemo, plus caption and styles.
import DemoFrame from './DemoFrame.astro';
import UnbundledPaymentDemo from '../demos/UnbundledPaymentDemo.tsx';
---
<figure class="unb-figure">
  <DemoFrame
    title="How $11 turns into $22 — and how end-to-end IDs stop it"
    titleVi="Cách $11 biến thành $22 — và cách request_id đầu-cuối chặn lại"
  >
    <UnbundledPaymentDemo client:visible />
  </DemoFrame>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Simulated transfer of $11.00 from Account A to Account B. Switch modes to compare a naive ACID transaction against an end-to-end <code>request_id</code> table and an unbundled 3-stage partitioned log, then try the short-funds scenario to see compensating apologies in action.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Mô phỏng giao dịch chuyển $11,00 từ Tài khoản A sang Tài khoản B. Chuyển đổi giữa ba kiến trúc để so sánh transaction ACID thông thường với bảng <code>request_id</code> đầu-cuối và log phân vùng 3 chặng, rồi thử kịch bản thiếu tiền để xem cơ chế bù trừ và xin lỗi hoạt động ra sao.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style is:global>
  .unb-figure {
    margin: 2em 0;
    width: 100%;
  }
  .unb-figure > .demo-frame {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }
  .unb-figure > figcaption {
    margin-top: 10px;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.55;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .unb .sd-stat span {
    text-transform: none;
    letter-spacing: 0;
    font-size: 12.5px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .unb .sd-stat b span {
    font-size: inherit;
    font-weight: inherit;
    color: inherit;
  }
  .unb-lock-val {
    font-size: 16px !important;
    line-height: 1.35 !important;
  }
  .unb-summary {
    margin: 0 0 14px;
    padding: 9px 12px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    background: var(--bg-alt);
    font-size: 13.5px;
    line-height: 1.45;
    color: var(--text-body);
  }
  .unb-summary.is-bad {
    border-color: var(--red);
    background: var(--red-tint-bg);
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .unb-summary.is-good {
    border-color: #16a34a;
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .unb-summary.is-warn {
    border-color: var(--gold);
    background: var(--gold-tint-bg);
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .unb-cols {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));
    gap: 16px;
  }
  .unb-h {
    margin: 0 0 8px;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .unb-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
  }
  .unb-step {
    padding: 9px 11px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: var(--bg-alt);
    font-size: 13px;
  }
  .unb-step.is-pending {
    opacity: 0.42;
  }
  .unb-step.is-active.is-bad {
    border-color: var(--red);
    background: var(--red-tint-bg);
  }
  .unb-step.is-active.is-good {
    border-color: #16a34a;
  }
  .unb-step.is-active.is-warn {
    border-color: var(--gold);
    background: var(--gold-tint-bg);
  }
  .unb-step.is-active.is-ok {
    border-color: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .unb-step-head {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px 8px;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }
  .unb-seq {
    font-size: 11.5px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
  .unb-actor {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .unb-tag {
    margin-left: auto;
    padding: 1px 7px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    background: var(--card-bg);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .unb-tag.is-bad {
    border-color: var(--red);
    color: var(--red);
  }
  .unb-tag.is-good {
    border-color: #16a34a;
    color: #15803d;
  }
  html[data-theme='dark'] .unb-tag.is-good {
    color: #4ade80;
  }
  .unb-tag.is-warn {
    border-color: var(--gold);
    color: var(--gold-icon);
  }
  .unb-step-detail {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 12.5px;
    line-height: 1.45;
    color: var(--text-body);
  }
  .unb-box {
    margin: 0 0 10px;
    padding: 10px 12px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: var(--bg-alt);
  }
  .unb-box-title {
    margin: 0 0 6px;
    font-size: 12.5px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .unb-empty {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 12.5px;
    line-height: 1.45;
    color: var(--text-faint);
  }
  .unb-rows {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 5px;
  }
  .unb-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 5px 8px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 6px;
    background: var(--card-bg);
    font-size: 12.5px;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
  .prose .unb-row code {
    padding: 0;
    border: 0;
    background: none;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .unb-row.is-good {
    border-color: #16a34a;
  }
  .unb-row.is-warn {
    border-color: var(--gold);
    background: var(--gold-tint-bg);
  }
  .unb-row.is-bad {
    border-color: var(--red);
    background: var(--red-tint-bg);
  }
</style>
